          text: 'Radical mechanisms are written with fishhooks. Bond **formation** between two radicals: one fishhook from each unpaired electron, meeting between the atoms. Bond **cleavage**: one fishhook from the bond to each atom. Count dots before and after a step: the number of unpaired electrons must balance.',
